.el .ds Aq '
.TH "bead search" 1  "bead search " 
.SH NAME
bead search \- Search issues by text
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead search\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-jsonl\fR] [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-\-assignee\fR] [\fB\-\-ready\fR] [\fB\-\-blocked\fR] [\fB\-\-comments\fR] [\fB\-\-fields\fR] [\fB\-\-notes\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-count\fR] [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITEXT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shortcut for `bead list \-\-all \-\-search TEXT`: case\-insensitive match
against title, description, and notes, ignoring \-\-limit so every match is
returned. Combines with \-\-status, \-\-assignee, and \-\-ready exactly as
`list \-\-search` does.
.PP
EXAMPLES:
  bead search "flaky test"                     # Same as: bead list \-\-all \-\-search \*(Aqflaky test\*(Aq
  bead search outage \-\-status open \-\-json       # Narrow to open issues, JSON output
  bead search outage \-\-ready                    # Only matches on the ready frontier
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output one JSON array
.TP
\fB\-\-jsonl\fR
Output one JSON object per line (empty results write no bytes)
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<STATUS>\fR
Filter by status
.TP
\fB\-\-assignee\fR \fI<ASSIGNEE>\fR
Filter by assignee
.TP
\fB\-\-ready\fR
Narrow the search to the ready frontier
.TP
\fB\-\-blocked\fR
Show only manually blocked open issues
.TP
\fB\-\-comments\fR \fI<COMMENTS>\fR [default: none]
Comment projection: none, unresolved, or all (default: none)
.TP
\fB\-\-fields\fR \fI<FIELDS>\fR
Comma\-separated projection of cli_issue document members (FIELD PROJECTION); without it every member is emitted
.TP
\fB\-\-notes\fR \fI<MODE>\fR [default: auto]
Notes projection: auto, none, tail:N, or all (default: auto)
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 100]
Maximum number of issues to return (0\-999999)
.TP
\fB\-\-count\fR
Print only the number of matching issues (ignores \-\-limit)
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show diagnostic information about filtering (SQL query, counts, exclusion reasons)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fITEXT\fR>
Text to match case\-insensitively against title, description, and notes
